This repository is a modified fork of the upstream project. It is not the
upstream project and is not endorsed by its author.

Changes in this fork:
- Credentials are read from environment variables, with optional support for a
  local secure vault. No credentials are stored in tracked files.
- Added a hardened local runner with resilient logging, session recovery,
  security-wall detection, and safer handling of application questions.
- Added a supervisor with restart limits, memory checks, and local network
  outage handling.
- Added optional title-gate, job-tracker, and candidate-knowledge integrations
  through environment variables. They are inactive when unset.
- Added sanitized configuration examples, a public-release cleanup, a
  compile-only CI workflow, and documentation.

Per-file copyright and license headers are retained. Files that carry an
upstream header remain subject to the upstream terms and the AGPL.
